      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SECRET BULLET (3) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 320m behind Classic Lass (19.11) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Boasts two wins from five starts out of this box. Looks the one to beat on her best form. SCOTT LOTTIE (6) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. Placed last time (20.44) at Goulburn in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths. Can feature in the finish. BOBBY JUNIOR (8) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only 0.8 lengths (18.55) behind Sleek Apollo at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Can feature again. LET'S WIN ROSIE (1) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
